# --- research data exports -------------------------------------------------
# Full dumps of the collected sessions: megabytes of generated data that can be
# rebuilt from the server at any time, and that git handles badly. The CODE
# that produces them is tracked; the output is not.
charweb_data/
charweb_export_*.tar.gz
*.sql

# Per-run feature tables and analysis inputs
# (regenerate with research/export_research_features.py).
m3_features.csv
blocked.csv
interleaved.csv
engineered_features.csv
sessions.csv
events.csv

# Collection manifests written by the batch runners. One pattern covers them
# all (ai_manifest.csv, ai_trials_manifest.csv, interleaved_manifest.csv, ...)
# so a new runner's manifest doesn't quietly become untracked clutter.
*manifest.csv

# ...but DO keep the analysis result files: they are small, and they are the
# record of what was actually run alongside the scripts that ran it.
!research/m3_results.txt
!research/m3_robustness_results.txt
!research/m3_task_transfer_results.txt

# --- backups, hand-labeling working files, scratch --------------------------
# backups/ holds timestamped export tarballs and analysis bundles (tens of MB,
# regenerable from the server). charweb_analysis_*.tar.gz is the same kind of
# artefact written at the repo root.
backups/
charweb_analysis_*.tar.gz

# SQLite backups. `*.db` above does not match `app.db.bak.<ts>` or
# `app.db.old_orphaned_chain`, and these contain the user table (emails,
# password hashes). hand_label_key.csv holds the auto-labeler's answers: it
# must never sit next to the blind sheet in a commit.
*.db.bak*
*.db.old_*
instance/
hand_label_key.csv

# Hand-labeling sheets are per-annotator working data, and diag.txt is
# one-off server diagnostic output. The sampler/scorer scripts are tracked.
hand_label_sheet.csv
overlap_sheet.csv
diag.txt

# git bundles (VPS -> laptop transfers)
*.bundle
REPO_DELTA.md

# generated poster/write-up figures (rebuild: python research/make_figures.py)
figures/

# M4 planning/draft docs: contain personal/identifying detail (school, location). Local only.
M4_*.md
PROJECT_STATUS.md
